        <headline>Lake Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 3:53PM PDT until September 25 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Hanford CA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...West winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 35 mph.

* WHERE...Kern River Valley including the Lake Isabella area.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM PDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds and rough waves on area lakes will create
hazardous conditions for small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
